35:["$","p",null,{"children":["With ",["$","code",null,{"children":"cache_metrics"}]," absent, Forge constructs the same store graph without\na wrapper, a timer, an attribute allocation or an OpenTelemetry call on the hot\npath. The feature costs nothing when it is off, which is why it is off."]}]
